 py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-16\">\r\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-6 sm:mb-8 lg:mb-10 drop-shadow-sm text-center\">🧠 Tips para estudiantes de software</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6\">\r\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-900/90 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-800 hover:border-red-500/30\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2\">💡 Aprende los fundamentos</h4>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300\">No corras detrás de tecnologías nuevas sin dominar primero lógica, estructuras de datos y algoritmos.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-900/90 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-800 hover:border-red-500/30\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2\">🔁 Practica resolviendo problemas</h4>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300\">Usa plataformas como SQLBolt, CodeCademy o Udemy para afinar tu lógica de programación.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-900/90 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-800 hover:border-red-500/30\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2\">🔗 Contribuye en GitHub</h4>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300\">No esperes terminar la carrera para crear proyectos y subirlos. Tu portafolio se construye hoy.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-900/90 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-800 hover:border-red-500/30\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2\">🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Busca comunidad</h4>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300\">Únete a comunidades tech, asiste a eventos o participa en grupos online. Aprendes más compartiendo.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <section class=\"py-8 sm:py-12 lg:py-16 text-center px-4 sm:px-6\">\r\n        <div class=\"bg-gray-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto border border-gray-800 shadow-3d\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-6 sm:mb-8 drop-shadow-sm\">🔗 Conéctate conmigo</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-6 sm:gap-8\">\r\n                <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jorge-luis-aparicio-alvarez-485277211/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 filter hover:drop-shadow-lg\">\r\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/174/174857.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10\" />\r\n                </a>\r\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/Japaricio2004\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 filter hover:drop-shadow-lg\">\r\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/25/25231.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10\" />\r\n                </a>\r\n                <a href=\"mailto:jorge2946237@gmail.com\" class=\"hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 filter hover:drop-shadow-lg\">\r\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/561/561127.png\" alt=\"Email\" class=\"w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10\" />\r\n                </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n  </main>\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n"